    {
      "row": 45,
      "values": [
        "This is a proposed task catalogue, not a benchmark or a diagnostic workflow. All case examples are synthetic. Sources support the surrounding methods, not the accuracy of Jev/Laya on these questions. Do not equate undocumented evidence with a negative finding, or discard uncertain and contradictory candidates automatically. Pin the model/version, count actual tokens and assess task-specific calibration before routing decisions. Scripts, specialist ML tools and self-hosted inference also have compute and maintenance costs; measure the whole workflow. Keep numerical analysis, raw-image/spectrum interpretation and final scientific or clinical judgments in their appropriate tools or with experts.",
        null,
